      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Tracking issue for the `#![feature(const_float_classify)]` feature gate, which makes the following methods on `f32` and `f64` `const fn`:\r\n\r\n- `classify`\r\n- `is_nan`\r\n- `is_infinite`\r\n- `is_finite`\r\n- `is_subnormal`\r\n- `is_normal`\r\n- `is_sign_positive`\r\n- `is_sign_negative`\r\n\r\nThese require #72447 (`#![feature(const_float_bits_conv)]`), so this is transitively blocked on https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/57241.",
      "closed_at": "2024-10-04T20:51:29Z",
